Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:41.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.89,0:26:44.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(朋友送上)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.39,0:29:25.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(圣经)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:31.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:34.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经过了一天半了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a day and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:38.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也什么都没找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't find any either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:42.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么知道 - 我就是知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:54.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,60英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}60 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问的不是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:52.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没油了 跟之前那辆一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're out, just like the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:53.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:22.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们状态不佳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not at our strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:26.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等安顿好了再去干掉它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get 'em when it's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:29.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找个高地之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High ground, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:32.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们哪里都会不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开亚特兰大已经三周了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been three weeks since Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:43.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在那里失去了某些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you lost something back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:50.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她饿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:57.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:02.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找到水 食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find water, food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:05.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在路上会有所发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll hit something in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:11.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迟早会下雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna rain sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:14.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去转一圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:16.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看能找到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what I can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:20.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别去太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't be too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:21.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:22.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要阻止我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找水时我找到了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found this when we were looking for water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:35.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:37.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这东西以前可以放音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it used to play music.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:40.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:44.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 卡尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:46.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你也许会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you might like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.51,0:07:00.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前开玩笑说这些东西是苦行者时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to joke these things were leftovers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.41,0:07:02.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遗留下来的粗毛衬衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the days of hair shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教堂实际上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The church actually made...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:10.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用粗毛做过衬衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shirts out of hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:13.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你穿上 就能靠受苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you wore it, you could atone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:15.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赎一点罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just a little for your sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:18.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道粗毛衬衣是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what a hair shirt is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.03,0:07:20.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸信教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daddy was religious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:23.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前也信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:29.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever want to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.65,0:07:31.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about your father
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:34.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者贝丝的事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or about Beth...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:35.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你住嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:41.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你准备好了 我洗耳恭听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whenever you're ready, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:43.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都没见过他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never even met them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:48.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我知道你很痛苦 - 你知道个屁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know you're in pain. - You don't know shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:51.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个牧师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:54.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你本该拯救你的信众 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were there to save your flock, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:55.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你躲起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:03.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别装作这一切没有发生过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't act like that didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:36.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以干掉它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can take 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:40.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:43.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的气力所剩无几\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We barely have anything left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要现在用尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No use in spending it all now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:49.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以干掉它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can take 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥当时也很愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother was pissed, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:56.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他失去了爱人之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after what he lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:01.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这让他变得愚蠢 - 我俩不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It made him stupid. - We are not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:06.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从来都不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never were.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:07.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:34.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:37.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 太干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's too dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里什么也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There ain't nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:40.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们应该往回走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should start back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:42.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:46.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得她救了我一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也救了你一命 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She saved your life, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:06.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是她的遗物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:18.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:22.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:34.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你不一样 我不能让自己…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're different. I can't let myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:40.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:44.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:49.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须要直面你的感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to let yourself feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:06.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:29.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:35.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持队形 从侧面掩护她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in line. Flank her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:37.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,控制住局势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:39.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划被搅乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plan just got dicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:46.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. Just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.07,0:13:12.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了让你住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:49.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:51.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去林子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna head into the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:04.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绕一圈看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}circle back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.31,0:14:06.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我能跟你一起去吗 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- May I come with? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:07.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:08.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:13.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:15.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面有只行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's one in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:19.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我关上了 它还在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I shut it and it's still in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:22.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.45,0:17:06.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:24.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到的只有酒吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So all we found was booze?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:26.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:30.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝酒没用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:31.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:33.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会让事情变得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:35.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:36.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个成年人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a grown man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:40.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真心不觉得事情还能变得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I truly do not know if things can get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.99,0:20:08.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:11.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he tried to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:17.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道自己能不能活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I'm gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:20.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就活不下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:30.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:33.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃东西吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:35.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛姬 喝点水吧 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maggie, take a drink. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:40.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:44.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那跟我聊聊天怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you just talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:50.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想到她还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought she was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:52.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:55.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸去世后 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After Daddy, I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.45,0:21:58.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:01.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听达里尔说过之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after what Daryl said,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:03.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望她仍在某处活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hoped she was out there, alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:06.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后发现她确实还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then finding out that she was
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:09.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可当天就失去了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then she wasn't in the same day...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:15.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到她那样 简直…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seeing her like that, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:21.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我觉得一切都那么不真实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}made it feel like none of it was ever really there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:26.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:30.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是我心头的阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this was just the dark part and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.78,0:22:36.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我不知道自己能不能拼下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I want to fight it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.03,0:22:38.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.43,0:22:40.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.94,0:22:43.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:48.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许这是当今世界的诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe it's a curse nowadays,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.99,0:22:50.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:52.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一路拼到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fought to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.31,0:22:55.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还得拼下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we have to keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:00.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝水吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:16.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝酒只会让事情变得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it'll just make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.43,0:23:20.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照你这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way you're going,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:24.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迟早会连累大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're what's gonna make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.61,0:23:31.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有我们这些朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:34.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们不是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.61,0:23:55.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.20,0:23:57.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不了 我不喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.65,0:23:59.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.40,0:24:02.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.69,0:24:07.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一起活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can make it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.82,0:24:10.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但只有我们在一起才能活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can only make it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.11,0:24:20.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们我去找水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them I went looking for water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.91,0:26:50.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还能做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:51.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正不能喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.53,0:26:53.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道是谁留下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know who left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.09,0:26:56.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是陷阱 我们已经深陷其中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's a trap, we already happen to be in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.66,0:26:59.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我愿意相信这真的是朋友送的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I, for one, would like to think it is indeed from a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.47,0:27:03.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是呢 如果有人在水里下药了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it isn't? They put something in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.61,0:27:07.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 尤金 - 你在干什么 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eugene. - What are you doing, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.80,0:27:09.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,验证质量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quality assurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.81,0:27:21.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.38,0:28:01.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.52,0:28:18.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.03,0:28:21.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都把包拿出来 所有能盛水的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody get the bags. Anything you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.29,0:28:23.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.23,0:28:24.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.97,0:28:47.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们接着走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.56,0:28:54.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 附近有一个谷仓 - 在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a barn. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.65,0:30:09.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.68,0:30:11.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本可以自杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She could have shot herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.49,0:30:15.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人无法放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.22,0:30:19.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.21,0:30:53.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我试试 - 不行 太湿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll try. - No, too wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.21,0:31:01.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.73,0:31:05.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的恢复能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He bounces back
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.90,0:31:07.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我们强多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more than any of us do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.48,0:31:11.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前会为在这个世界成长的孩子感到难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to feel sorry for kids that have to grow up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.03,0:31:13.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个末世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.28,0:31:18.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我觉得我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think I got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.00,0:31:23.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成长就是适应这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Growing up is getting used to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.43,0:31:28.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对他们来说更容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is easier for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.89,0:31:30.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.06,0:31:34.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.65,0:31:43.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.92,0:31:47.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.98,0:31:50.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是放弃 - 这是现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's giving up. - It's reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.58,0:31:54.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在看到希望之前 我们得接受这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until we see otherwise, this is what we have to live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.63,0:32:10.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.12,0:32:16.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问过我爷爷是否在战争中杀过德国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked my grandpa once if he ever killed any Germans in the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.85,0:32:21.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不愿回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wouldn't answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.51,0:32:26.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说那是成年人的事 所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said that was grown-up stuff, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.96,0:32:32.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我问他德国人有没有试图杀过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I asked if the Germans ever tried to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.28,0:32:37.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他却异常沉默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he got real quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.60,0:32:48.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说从他踏进敌占区那一刻就已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he was dead the minute he stepped into enemy territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.61,0:32:54.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他每天醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day he woke up
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.86,0:32:57.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就告诉自己 安息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and told himself, "Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.89,0:32:59.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后起床去打仗吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get up and go to war."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.42,0:33:06.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假装自己已经死了几年之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then after a few years of pretending he was dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.63,0:33:12.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他活着回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he made it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.89,0:33:16.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那大概就是诀窍吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the trick of it, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.09,0:33:20.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做我们该做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do what we need to do
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.46,0:33:24.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样才能活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then we get to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.12,0:33:28.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但无论我们在华府发现什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no matter what we find in DC,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.47,0:33:30.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们都会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know we'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.26,0:33:35.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们就是这样活下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because this is how we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.51,0:33:40.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们告诉自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tell ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.97,0:33:45.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是行尸走肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we are the walking dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.44,0:34:01.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.97,0:34:16.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.17,0:34:21.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.89,0:34:29.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.55,0:37:34.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该去睡会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.96,0:37:37.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.04,0:37:41.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在可以休息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay to rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.57,0:37:49.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.95,0:37:52.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.66,0:37:58.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So was she.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.29,0:38:02.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她自己不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.09,0:38:05.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她很坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.38,0:38:24.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,齿轮箱进了点沙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gearbox had some grit in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.51,0:38:26.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.13,0:38:56.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.72,0:39:30.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.54,0:39:37.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按理说我们也会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should have torn us apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.67,0:39:42.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.33,0:40:06.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.07,0:40:10.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.28,0:40:18.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂你的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.81,0:40:26.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚 那个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah, that kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.06,0:40:33.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他不知道自己能不能活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he said he didn't know if he can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.76,0:40:42.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有同感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.28,0:40:47.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.69,0:40:54.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩都会活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both of us, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.27,0:40:58.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是最难的部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.66,0:41:13.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔修好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daryl fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.76,0:41:30.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没搞错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.34,0:41:39.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无意打扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't mean to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.84,0:41:41.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.57,0:41:44.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫亚伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.25,0:41:50.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 陌生人很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, stranger danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.33,0:41:54.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我是你们的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.61,0:42:00.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想和管事的人谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to talk to the person in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.28,0:42:02.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.36,0:42:04.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么知道 - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know... - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.17,0:42:07.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have good news.
